@startuml UC-41 Update Class Resource - Sequence Diagram (icon)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.13.2.2 UC-41 Update Class Resource — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher
boundary ":ClassResourcesPage" as UI
boundary ":ResourceFormPanel" as FORM
control ":ClassController" as CTL
control ":ClassResourceService" as SVC
boundary ":ClassResourceRepository" as RES
database DB

autonumber
Teacher ->> UI : Select "Edit" on a resource of an owned ACTIVE class
activate UI
UI ->> FORM : Open the form filled with the stored resource information
activate FORM
Teacher ->> FORM : Change the title, description, attachment, submission setting or deadline, then click "Save"
FORM ->> FORM : handleSubmit(event)
FORM ->> CTL : PATCH /api/classes/{id}/resources/{resourceId}
activate CTL
CTL ->> SVC : updateResource(classId, resourceId, resourceChanges)
activate SVC
SVC ->> SVC : resolve the class and accept only an owned class that is still ACTIVE
SVC ->> RES : findById(resourceId)
activate RES
RES ->> DB : SELECT * FROM class_resources WHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB -->> RES : row / none
deactivate DB
RES -->> SVC : ClassResource
deactivate RES
SVC ->> SVC : accept only a resource of that class, keep the fields left untouched, refuse an attachment on a Personal Library snapshot, and require a future deadline when submissions are enabled

alt class is not owned or is INACTIVE, the resource is not in the class, or the changes are invalid
  SVC -->> CTL : ForbiddenOperationException / ResourceNotFoundException / IllegalArgumentException
  CTL -->> FORM : HTTP 403 / 404 / 400
  FORM -->> Teacher : Show MSG23 or the invalid-field message and keep the current edits in the form

else the teacher owns an ACTIVE class and the entered changes are valid
  SVC ->> RES : save(ClassResource with the updated resource and assignment information)
  activate RES
  RES ->> DB : UPDATE class_resources SET resource and assignment fields, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
  activate DB
  DB -->> RES : Saved
  deactivate DB
  RES -->> SVC : ClassResource
  deactivate RES
  SVC -->> CTL : ResourceSummary
  CTL -->> FORM : HTTP 200 + ClassResourceSummary
  FORM ->> UI : saved(resource)
  deactivate FORM
  UI -->> Teacher : Show MSG08 and the updated resource; the source Personal Library item stays unchanged
end
deactivate SVC
deactivate CTL
deactivate UI
@enduml
